 man is found in the jaws of a reconstructed dinosaur.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4eaab487a425f62b2f09f995b12f32c/rokuFeed/assets/56bab9bae849592ba98c09e7a5235c7a.jpg","ep":"S02E03"},{"s":1795364100,"e":1795367460,"t":"Murdoch Mysteries","st":"Murdoch Mysteries","d":"Harry Houdini becomes a suspect in a robbery-homicide case; Dr. Ogden's sister comes to visit.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4eaab487a425f62b2f09f995b12f32c/rokuFeed/assets/56bab9bae849592ba98c09e7a5235c7a.jpg","ep":"S02E04"},{"s":1795367460,"e":1795370820,"t":"Murdoch Mysteries","st":"Murdoch Mysteries","d":"Murdoch and Dr. Ogden's relationship is strained when they have different opinions about abortion.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4eaab487a425f62b2f09f995b12f32c/rokuFeed/assets/56bab9bae849592ba98c09e7a5235c7a.jpg","ep":"S02E06"},{"s":1795367460,"e":1795370820,"t":"Murdoch Mysteries","st":"Murdoch Mysteries","d":"Murdoch and Dr. Ogden's relationship is strained when they have different opinions about abortion.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4eaab487a425f62b2f09f995b12f32c/rokuFeed/assets/56bab9bae849592ba98c09e7a5235c7a.jpg","ep":"S02E06"},{"s":1795370820,"e":1795374180,"t":"Murdoch Mysteries","st":"Murdoch Mysteries","d":"Murdoch finds himself attracted to a widow whose son is missing.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4eaab487a425f62b2f09f995b12f32c/rokuFeed/assets/56bab9bae849592ba98c09e7a5235c7a.jpg","ep":"S02E08"},{"s":1795374180,"e":1795377540,"t":"Murdoch Mysteries","st":"Murdoch Mysteries","d":"Nathan drops dead while praying in the synagogue, and all signs point to a love triangle.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4eaab487a425f62b2f09f995b12f32c/rokuFeed/assets/56bab9bae849592ba98c09e7a5235c7a.jpg","ep":"S02E09"},{"s":1795377540,"e":1795381200,"t":"Murdoch Mysteries","st":"Murdoch Mysteri